Spec: SpecDD Plugin Implementation

Platform: IntelliJ Platform / Kotlin

Purpose:
  Govern implementation files under the `src` project root.

Structure:
  ./main/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea: SpecDD language package namespace.
  ./main/resources/META-INF: IntelliJ plugin metadata.
  ./main/resources/ai/specdd/idea/documentation: Packaged SpecDD documentation text.

Owns:
  ./main/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/*
  ./main/resources/META-INF/plugin.sdd
  ./main/resources/META-INF/plugin.xml
  ./main/resources/META-INF/logo.svg
  ./main/resources/META-INF/pluginIcon.svg
  ./main/resources/ai/specdd/idea/documentation/*

Can modify:
  ./main/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/*
  ./main/resources/META-INF/plugin.sdd
  ./main/resources/META-INF/plugin.xml
  ./main/resources/META-INF/logo.svg
  ./main/resources/META-INF/pluginIcon.svg
  ./main/resources/ai/specdd/idea/documentation/*

Must:
  Keep implementation code under the `ai.specdd.idea` package namespace.
  Keep syntax highlighting and language validation as separate concerns.

Must not:
  Add user-facing settings or configuration UI.
